<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Sh. Nikhil Kumar @ Nikhil Kr. Goswami &amp; Ors. v. State (Govt. of NCT of Delhi), CRL.M.C. 8422/2026</td></tr>
